[
 {
  "text": "Even if your boss in Japan wants to fire you,",
  "s": 0.0,
  "e": 2.56,
  "w0": 0,
  "w1": 9
 },
 {
  "text": "chances are they can't.",
  "s": 2.84,
  "e": 4.06,
  "w0": 10,
  "w1": 13
 },
 {
  "text": "Mr.",
  "s": 4.34,
  "e": 4.56,
  "w0": 14,
  "w1": 14
 },
 {
  "text": "Tanaka has been at the same company for twenty years,",
  "s": 4.62,
  "e": 7.04,
  "w0": 15,
  "w1": 24
 },
 {
  "text": "and one morning the boss decides Tanaka has to go.",
  "s": 7.32,
  "e": 9.94,
  "w0": 25,
  "w1": 34
 },
 {
  "text": "But Japanese labor law is clear:",
  "s": 10.22,
  "e": 11.92,
  "w0": 35,
  "w1": 40
 },
 {
  "text": "without a just and reasonable cause,",
  "s": 12.22,
  "e": 13.9,
  "w0": 41,
  "w1": 46
 },
 {
  "text": "firing is invalid.",
  "s": 14.38,
  "e": 15.28,
  "w0": 47,
  "w1": 49
 },
 {
  "text": "Calling someone unproductive isn't enough most of the time.",
  "s": 15.82,
  "e": 18.5,
  "w0": 50,
  "w1": 58
 },
 {
  "text": "Even saying the company is downsizing isn't enough.",
  "s": 18.78,
  "e": 21.38,
  "w0": 59,
  "w1": 66
 },
 {
  "text": "So what does the company do?",
  "s": 21.72,
  "e": 23.04,
  "w0": 67,
  "w1": 72
 },
 {
  "text": "Instead of firing Tanaka,",
  "s": 23.42,
  "e": 24.68,
  "w0": 73,
  "w1": 76
 },
 {
  "text": "they bore him out.",
  "s": 24.94,
  "e": 25.7,
  "w0": 77,
  "w1": 80
 },
 {
  "text": "They put him in a completely empty room.",
  "s": 26.0,
  "e": 27.82,
  "w0": 81,
  "w1": 88
 },
 {
  "text": "There's a desk and a chair.",
  "s": 27.82,
  "e": 29.32,
  "w0": 89,
  "w1": 94
 },
 {
  "text": "No computer,",
  "s": 29.64,
  "e": 30.28,
  "w0": 95,
  "w1": 96
 },
 {
  "text": "no phone,",
  "s": 30.66,
  "e": 31.24,
  "w0": 97,
  "w1": 98
 },
 {
  "text": "no work.",
  "s": 31.56,
  "e": 32.1,
  "w0": 99,
  "w1": 100
 },
 {
  "text": "The Japanese call this oidashi beya.",
  "s": 32.56,
  "e": 34.68,
  "w0": 101,
  "w1": 106
 },
 {
  "text": "Basically,",
  "s": 34.68,
  "e": 35.14,
  "w0": 107,
  "w1": 107
 },
 {
  "text": "a firing room.",
  "s": 35.46,
  "e": 36.46,
  "w0": 108,
  "w1": 110
 },
 {
  "text": "From nine to five,",
  "s": 36.8,
  "e": 38.06,
  "w0": 111,
  "w1": 114
 },
 {
  "text": "Tanaka stares at the wall.",
  "s": 38.06,
  "e": 39.4,
  "w0": 115,
  "w1": 119
 },
 {
  "text": "Stares out the window,",
  "s": 39.74,
  "e": 40.64,
  "w0": 120,
  "w1": 123
 },
 {
  "text": "counts the hours.",
  "s": 41.0,
  "e": 41.74,
  "w0": 124,
  "w1": 126
 },
 {
  "text": "The goal is obvious:",
  "s": 42.18,
  "e": 43.08,
  "w0": 127,
  "w1": 130
 },
 {
  "text": "make him bored and ashamed so he resigns on his own.",
  "s": 43.46,
  "e": 46.1,
  "w0": 131,
  "w1": 141
 },
 {
  "text": "But there's another side to it.",
  "s": 46.38,
  "e": 47.64,
  "w0": 142,
  "w1": 147
 },
 {
  "text": "In Japan,",
  "s": 47.98,
  "e": 48.42,
  "w0": 148,
  "w1": 149
 },
 {
  "text": "resigning isn't easy either.",
  "s": 48.78,
  "e": 50.12,
  "w0": 150,
  "w1": 153
 },
 {
  "text": "The boss tears up the resignation letter.",
  "s": 50.48,
  "e": 52.32,
  "w0": 154,
  "w1": 160
 },
 {
  "text": "\"What will the team do if you leave?\" Because of that,",
  "s": 52.7,
  "e": 55.04,
  "w0": 161,
  "w1": 171
 },
 {
  "text": "people now pay to have someone resign for them.",
  "s": 55.32,
  "e": 57.44,
  "w0": 172,
  "w1": 180
 },
 {
  "text": "You hire an agency,",
  "s": 57.44,
  "e": 58.72,
  "w0": 181,
  "w1": 184
 },
 {
  "text": "they call your boss,",
  "s": 59.06,
  "e": 59.86,
  "w0": 185,
  "w1": 188
 },
 {
  "text": "and the best part is,",
  "s": 60.22,
  "e": 61.3,
  "w0": 189,
  "w1": 193
 },
 {
  "text": "in twenty twenty-four,",
  "s": 61.52,
  "e": 62.88,
  "w0": 194,
  "w1": 196
 },
 {
  "text": "an employee at a resignation agency wanted to quit.",
  "s": 62.88,
  "e": 65.54,
  "w0": 197,
  "w1": 205
 },
 {
  "text": "Guess what they did?",
  "s": 65.96,
  "e": 66.72,
  "w0": 206,
  "w1": 209
 },
 {
  "text": "They hired another resignation agency.",
  "s": 67.04,
  "e": 69.08,
  "w0": 210,
  "w1": 214
 },
 {
  "text": "Yeah.",
  "s": 69.42,
  "e": 69.66,
  "w0": 215,
  "w1": 215
 }
]